{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-26","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"physics","number":26,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","unitLabel":"유체·열역학","topic":"유체·피스톤·압력","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-fluid-thermal","physics-mechanics"],"stem":"그림은유압장치를이용하여물체D에힘을작용하는것을\n나타낸것이다. 피스톤A를미는힘은10 N이며, 이힘이서로\n연결된두실린더내부의비압축성유체에미치는압력은피스톤\nB에힘을작용한다. B는고정된회전축을중심으로돌수있는\n강체C의한지점(회전축으로부터의거리가L 인곳)을수직으로\n밀며, C의끝부분은D를민다. A, B의단면적은각각10 cm2,\n100 cm2이고, 유압장치와모든물체는힘의평형을이루어정지\n상태에있다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n(단, 실린더는고정되어있으며, 유체에미치는중력의영향, C의\n질량과굵기, 실린더내부및회전축의마찰, 유체의점성, 모든\n변형은무시한다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. B가C를미는힘은100 N이다.\nㄴ. 회전축에대한C에작용하는돌림힘(토크)의합은0이다.\nㄷ. C가D를미는힘은200 N이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":662,"height":311,"region":0,"bbox":[31.656,166.068,264.8,124.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-26/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":161,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,389.668,308.8,64.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-26/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,652.968],"width":333.756,"height":500.236,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[31.656,166.068,264.8,124.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.456,389.668,308.8,64.4],"section":"s